---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
const updated = 'October 11, 2026';
---
<PageLayout title="Privacy Policy" description={`Privacy policy for ${SITE.name}`}>
  <p><em>Last updated: {updated}</em></p>
  <p>This Privacy Policy explains how {SITE.name} (“we”, “us”) collects and uses information when you visit {SITE.url}.</p>
  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Information you give us</strong> — such as your name and email when you contact us or join our newsletter.</li>
    <li><strong>Automatic information</strong> — standard log data such as browser type, pages visited and approximate location, collected by our hosting provider and analytics tools.</li>
    <li><strong>Preferences</strong> — your text-size and night-mode choices are stored only in your own browser (local storage).</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
  <p>We use Google AdSense to show advertisements. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this website or other websites. Google’s use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visits to this and/or other sites on the Internet.</p>
  <p>You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google Ads Settings</a>, or opt out of some third-party vendors’ use of cookies at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" rel="noopener" target="_blank">www.aboutads.info</a>. Learn more in <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener" target="_blank">How Google uses data when you use our partners’ sites</a>.</p>
  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors use our site — for example which pages are read and which links are clicked — so we can improve it. We may also use Microsoft Clarity, which records anonymous mouse movements and clicks to help us fix usability problems. These services use cookies and collect information such as your device, browser, approximate location and pages visited. They do not receive your name or email. Learn more in <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google’s privacy information</a> and the <a href="https://privacy.microsoft.com/privacystatement" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Microsoft Privacy Statement</a>. You can opt out of Google Analytics with the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google Analytics opt-out add-on</a>.</p>
  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>Some links are affiliate links. Retailers may use cookies to track purchases made through them. See our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure">Affiliate Disclosure</a>.</p>
  <h2>Embedded videos</h2>
  <p>YouTube videos load only after you press play and use YouTube’s privacy-enhanced mode. Once played, YouTube’s own privacy policy applies.</p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>Depending on where you live (for example California or the European Union), you may have the right to access, correct or delete your personal information. Contact us at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This site is not directed to children under 13 and we do not knowingly collect their information.</p>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date above shows the latest version.</p>
</PageLayout>
